# Project discoveries — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

Verified findings about the physical system, established across the project and true beyond any single
campaign. A campaign's journal Findings entry is promoted here only when (a) it is independently
`verify`-CONFIRMED, and (b) it is a fact about the system rather than a config that scored well in one
campaign. Promotion survives fork-and-archive: a discovery outlives the campaign that found it.

Append-only. Number entries D1, D2, …. To overturn or narrow one, add a `REVISES` entry. Never delete.
**Writes here are hook-gated** (each campaign's `scripts/guard_promotion.py`): every entry must cite the
source campaign's verdict artifact by path — `campaigns/<slug>/results/verdicts/<id>.json` — and the
gate also requires that campaign's correctness suite to be an affirmative, non-stale green.

